  "application_type_full": "Full planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The application is not supported by sufficient ecological information, including a Preliminary Roost Assessment, and ground-level tree assessment. As a result, the Local Planning Authority cannot properly assess the likely effects of the development on protected species, habitats, and the ecological value of nearby Sites of Importance for Nature Conservation, (namely Bentley Priory and Stanmore Common). In the absence of such information, it has not been demonstrated that the proposal would conserve and enhance biodiversity or avoid unacceptable ecological harm. The proposal therefore fails to comply with Policy G6 of the London Plan and Policy GI3 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;In the absence of accurate proposed sectional drawings, it has not been demonstrated that an inclusive and high quality internal environment in terms of daylight penetration, ventilation and cooling, and sense of space would be created. The development could therefore result in a substandard quality of accommodation to the detriment of the residential amenities of future occupiers. As such, in the absence of section drawings, the development has failed to demonstrate the requirements of Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021) and Policies GR1 and HO2 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt; In the absence of a detailed noise report, including any necessary mitigation measures, the Local Planning Authority is unable to make a full assessment of the impacts of the proposed heat pumps and Air Conditioning Units on the residential amenities of adjoining neighbours with regard to noise and disturbance, contrary to the National Planning Policy Framework, Policies D3 and D14 of the London Plan (2021) and Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
